cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use CGA-Bench in your research, please cite it using the metadata below."
type: dataset
title: "CGA-Bench: Clinical Guideline Adherence Benchmark"
abstract: >
  CGA-Bench is a trace-level evaluation benchmark for medical AI agents, measuring
  adherence to time-sensitive clinical treatment protocols from 25 clinical practice
  guidelines (SSC, AHA, KDIGO, ADA, ESC, ATS/IDSA, GOLD, ACG, ACLS, AABB, and
  others). The benchmark comprises 1,049 typed constraints (REQUIRED, FORBIDDEN,
  BEFORE, WITHIN), 706 evaluation scenarios (107 manual + 599 auto-generated), and
  16,944 agent episode traces across 8 models. A scoring-agent information separation
  is enforced to prevent evaluation leakage.
version: "6.0"
date-released: "2026-04-10"
license: CC-BY-4.0
authors:
  - name: "CGA-Bench Authors"
    # Individual author entries (with ORCID, affiliation, email) will be populated at
    # camera-ready. Withheld during NeurIPS 2026 D&B double-blind review.
